# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Sample the checked circuit {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"
msgstr "3. Lakukan sampling pada circuit yang sudah dicek {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before we sample, we transpile the checked circuit onto physical qubits (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) and into `ibm_boston`'s native basis gate set. To emulate a noisy QPU, we sample with a noisy Aer stabilizer backend whose error rates match the `noise_model` used to pick checks.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum sampling, kita transpile circuit yang sudah dicek ke qubit fisik (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) dan ke himpunan basis gate native milik `ibm_boston`. Untuk meniru QPU yang noisy, kita lakukan sampling dengan backend stabilizer Aer yang noisy, dengan laju error yang cocok dengan `noise_model` yang dipakai untuk memilih check.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Postselect samples with no detected error {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"
msgstr "4. Postselect sampel tanpa error terdeteksi {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`get_postselection_method` maps each shot to its syndrome vector; we keep only the shots with an all-zero syndrome &mdash; those in which no check detected an error. Discarding the flagged shots removes detected errors from the surviving distribution, improving its fidelity at the cost of a lower sampling rate. See the [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) for a quantitative fidelity comparison.\n"
msgstr "`get_postselection_method` memetakan setiap shot ke vektor sindrom-nya; kita hanya menyimpan shot dengan sindrom nol semua &mdash; yaitu shot di mana tidak ada check yang mendeteksi error. Membuang shot yang ditandai akan menghilangkan error yang terdeteksi dari distribusi yang tersisa, sehingga fidelity-nya naik dengan konsekuensi laju sampling yang lebih rendah. Lihat [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) untuk perbandingan fidelity secara kuantitatif.\n"
